The library core (hepsimlib.library: hashing, axes, domain accounting, manifest, store, registry, dtypes, run
provenance, fidelity vocabulary), the component interaction banks (hepsimlib.component) and their tests and
documentation were extracted from mu2e-fastsim-core (commit a058b04) and generalized to be experiment-neutral: the
Mu2e-specific settings became the experiment profile (hepsimlib.profile). The capture audit, energy accounting and
converter (hepsimlib.capture) were extracted from the same commit, without the checks specific to the Mu2e Geant4
framework; the recorder (recorder/) was written for this package. That code carries the copyright above.

No experiment-internal inputs, conditions, data, libraries or physics results are part of this repository.
